        "payload": "tree b58bba1afb86eff9865ccc2705eb36e65760889a\nparent 31247735f64c1a3cd3ca9cb5e7685db6f4f265c9\nauthor HanZijie <HanZijie@users.noreply.github.com> 1792571711 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1792571711 +0800\n\nREADME: swap in the CadQuery Viewer annotate-and-edit case, drop the route planner case (#53)\n\nThe CadQuery Viewer case GIF now shows the full loop: one prompt builds the\nMiniMax octopus model, the user marks the mouth on the model and asks for red,\nand the Agent rebuilds it while the Viewer refreshes. Captions in both READMEs\ndescribe this flow. The Self-drive Route Planner case is removed from the root\nREADMEs; its image stays in the plugin, whose own README still uses it.\n\nCo-authored-by: minimax <zijiehan1998@gmail.com>",
        "verified_at": "2026-10-21T08:35:11Z"
      }
    },
